  "body": "CCC & Title issued, ready to move in!\r\n\r\n4 Bedrooms | 3.5 bathrooms (including 2 Ensuites) | 168m² Floor Area (MOL) | 162m² Freehold Section (MOL) | Internal garage +off-street Parking\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n• Freehold, freestanding home offering spacious 168m²(MOL) double-level living with a single internal garage with additional off-street parking \r\n• 4 Spacious bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms (including 2 private ensuites) - providing exceptional comfort and convenience for modern family living.\r\n• Open-plan dining and kitchen area are beautifully designed with style and space in mind — ideal for entertaining or relaxed everyday living.\r\n• Step outside to a sun-soaked deck, perfectly positioned to capture all day sunlight — great for entertaining family and friends. The fully fenced backyard is low-maintenance and provides a safe, secure space for kids to play.\r\n• Modern, fully equipped kitchen featuring Bosch appliances and a powerful Fotile rangehood — designed to eliminate cooking fumes for a clean, fresh cooking environment.\r\n• A wide range of high-spec chattels, such as 3 heat pumps, LED mirrors, double-glazed windows, underground heating upstairs bathroom and an advanced build in sound system — offering both comfort and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nZoned for Top Schools, all within walking distance.\r\n• Pigeon Mountain School\r\n• Bucklands Beach Intermediate\r\n• Macleans College\r\nFamilies will appreciate being in one of East Auckland’s most sought-after school zones.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location:\r\nLocated in the prestigious Half Moon Bay, you’ll enjoy a vibrant coastal lifestyle close to the stunning Half Moon Bay Marina. A short drive connects you to a wide selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, and ferry services to the Auckland CBD. Whether it's sailing at the local yacht club or enjoying the scenic waterfront, this location truly offers convenience and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss your chance to move into one of East Auckland’s most desirable suburbs — with top-tier education & coastal living. Call now to book a private viewing or visit us at the next open home. You won’t be disappointed!\r\n\r\n\r\nNote: While care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, no responsibility is accepted for the accuracy of the whole or any part thereof and interested persons are advised to make their own enquiries and satisfy themselves in all respects.",
